# Rip and Tear
*Level 5 Transmutation (Druid, Ranger)*

**Casting Time:** Action  
**Range:** Self  
**Components:** V. S  
**Duration:** Instantaneous

Your body briefly transforms, taking on aspects of a savage beast - your nails harden, your teeth sharpen, and your body becomes primed to pounce.  
You leap up to 20 feet to an unoccupied space you can see, and immediately make a melee spell attack against a creature within 5 feet of you. The leap does not provoke Opportunity Attacks. On a hit, the attack deals 4d12 Force damage.  
You perform this leap and attack in this way up to four times in total. You can attack the same target more than once, but no two successive attacks can be made against the same target.

***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can leap and attack one additional time for each spell slot level above 5.

